*$t$** | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | {{field-1}} | $-14$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | {{field-2}} |"] [:db/add "ae109e7c-040d-5915-83ac-8deca83290cb" :question/worked-solution "The missing entry is in the $x$-row under $t=1$. Substitute into $x=- t^{3} - 2 t - 2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(1) &=- \\left(1\\right)^{3} - 2 \\left(1\\right) - 2 \\\\ &=-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe missing entry is in the $y$-row under $t=2$. Substitute into $y=t - 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(2) &=\\left(2\\right) - 1 \\\\ &=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe missing entry is in the $y$-row under $t=0$. Substitute into $y=t - 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) &=\\left(0\\right) - 1 \\\\ &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe completed table is\n\n| **$t$** | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $10$ | $1$ | $-2$ |\n| $y$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ |\n\n| **$t$** | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-5$ | $-14$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ |"] [:db/add "ae109e7c-040d-5915-83ac-8deca83290cb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ae109e7c-040d-5915-83ac-8deca83290cb" :question/answer-fields "5aa2d4a5-ddb4-5194-bbf6-8c3545f0e56b"] [:db/add "ae109e7c-040d-5915-83ac-8deca83290cb" :question/answer-fields "6885b268-5994-5727-8ed7-801748d29ac1"] [:db/add "ae109e7c-040d-5915-83ac-8deca83290cb" :question/answer-fields "4f0a4ce2-be81-567f-bf25-76cc6334194f"] [:db/ensure "ae109e7c-040d-5915-83ac-8deca83290cb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087717 :knowledge-point/questions "ae109e7c-040d-5915-83ac-8deca83290cb"] [:db/add "8383308f-2a71-5ad9-ab48-2d8bb50b4cbc" :answer/id #uuid "8383308f-2a71-5ad9-ab48-2d8bb50b4cbc"] [:db/add "8383308f-2a71-5ad9-ab48-2d8bb50b4cbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8383308f-2a71-5ad9-ab48-2d8bb50b4cbc" :answer/value "- \\sqrt{5}"] [:db/ensure "8383308f-2a71-5ad9-ab48-2d8bb50b4cbc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e71c11b6-9ba8-5deb-b35c-ce927364c244" :answer-field/id #uuid "e71c11b6-9ba8-5deb-b35c-ce927364c244"] [:db/add "e71c11b6-9ba8-5deb-b