ices "e0f88b88-856f-5030-aa8d-8343fa9b372f"] [:db/add "6c97f634-6131-5d50-86cb-2461edfb42d1" :answer-field/correct "e0f88b88-856f-5030-aa8d-8343fa9b372f"] [:db/ensure "6c97f634-6131-5d50-86cb-2461edfb42d1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9041a575-6f1d-552b-b837-3cb6733640f8" :question/id #uuid "9041a575-6f1d-552b-b837-3cb6733640f8"] [:db/add "9041a575-6f1d-552b-b837-3cb6733640f8" :question/problem "Consider the curve with parametric equations\n\n$$\nx=- \\sqrt{t + 3},\\qquad y=t^{2} - t - 1,\\qquad -2\\le t\\le 2.\n$$\n\nFill in the three blanks in the table. Give exact values.\n\n| **$t$** | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-1$ | $- \\sqrt{2}$ | $- \\sqrt{3}$ |\n| $y$ | $5$ | {{field-2}} | $-1$ |\n\n| **$t$** | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | {{field-3}} | {{field-1}} |\n| $y$ | $-1$ | $1$ |"] [:db/add "9041a575-6f1d-552b-b837-3cb6733640f8" :question/worked-solution "The missing entry is in the $x$-row under $t=2$. Substitute into $x=- \\sqrt{t + 3}$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(2) &=- \\sqrt{\\left(2\\right) + 3} \\\\ &=- \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe missing entry is in the $y$-row under $t=-1$. Substitute into $y=t^{2} - t - 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(-1) &=\\left(-1\\right)^{2} - \\left(-1\\right) - 1 \\\\ &=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe missing entry is in the $x$-row under $t=1$. Substitute into $x=- \\sqrt{t + 3}$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(1) &=- \\sqrt{\\left(1\\right) + 3} \\\\ &=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe completed table is\n\n| **$t$** | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-1$ | $- \\sqrt{2}$ | $- \\sqrt{3}$ |\n| $y$ | $5$ | $1$ | $-1$ |\n\n| **$t$** | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-2$ | $- \\sqrt{5}$ |\n| $y$ | $-1$ | $1$ |"] [:db/add "9041a575-6f1d-552b-b837-3cb6733640f8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "9041a575-6f1d-552b-b837-3cb6733640f8" :question/answer-fields "e71c11b6-9ba8-5deb-b35c-ce927364c244"] [:db/add "9041a575-6f1d-552b-b837-3cb6733640f8" :